e controls as Jedi-to-be Anakin Skywalker or any one of over 20 pod racers. These lightning-quick vehicles are capable of reaching simulated speeds of up to 600 miles per hour while skimming a mere 4 feet above the ground. Feel the full-force blast while avoiding hazards such as methane lakes, meteor showers, and the notorious Tusken Raiders. You can race alone or against a friend in split-screen mode on more than 21 courses that span over 8 different worlds. This level of customization adds excellent replay value.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/star-wars-episode-i-racer", "videos": [{"id": 62, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "QfmBfJzt_io", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QfmBfJzt_io", "title": "Star Wars-Episode 1-Pod-Racer - Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QfmBfJzt_io/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 138574, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "habVbRgyq9E", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=habVbRgyq9E", "title": "Star Wars Episode I: Racer \u2014 Launch Trailer | PS4", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/habVbRgyq9E/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 4192, "name": "Star Wars: Racer"}]}